,null,["沒有特別"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ACCESSIBILITY_TIPS"],"無障礙設施",null,null,"分享無障礙空間相關資訊","無障礙設施",null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3IcHCO8BKB8",null,null,["店位在地下一樓，不然店內空間大輪椅應該是好進出的"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:VEGETARIAN_OPTIONS"],"素食餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3YcHCPEBKAA"],[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3YcHCPIBKAE"],[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3YcHCPMBKAI"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3YcHCPQBKAM"],[["E:ACCESSIBILITY"],"無障礙設施",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3YcHCPUBKAQ"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj0vKGasteWAxX7YPUHHeAAEWoQ3IcHCPABKCA",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026.02.25 到訪用餐🍜\n（2026.03.24二訪！）\n這家存很久了，位於頂好名品城地下一樓，從忠孝那邊的樓梯下去馬上就是了！！尖峰時間來的話肯定是要排隊的，上次6:50左右抵達前面有三組（二訪的時候6:20抵達目前不用排隊！）\n-\n點餐是用點餐機，只能現金付款（但有提供刷載具的發票），老闆是日本人，整個就是非常道地日本感，店內空間蠻大的，用餐起來也還算舒適～\n-\n麵鹹度可以分日本鹹度跟台灣鹹度，據同行夥伴一訪的心得是日本鹹度有點過鹹，他這次點台灣鹹度覺得適中也比較好吃😋\n這次點了濃厚牡蠣雞白湯，另外加了牡蠣（因為點特製的話會多肉，但只有想多加牡蠣🦪）\n覺得整體味道很喜歡！濃郁但又吃得到個別的味道，不會都彼此混在在一起，是吃得懂的好吃拉麵！\n另一個點的是香辣魚介雞白湯，也是濃厚好吃，但香辣調味料真的蠻辣的，加下去又是另一種感覺💕\n牡蠣炊飯也好吃！飯的口感軟硬適中～覺得很不錯\n整體來說推推！！是路過會想走進來吃的拉麵店🍜",null,[0,32]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15754959952096567650/custo